flowchart LR
    U[Customer Browser / Mobile App]
    CDN[CDN / Edge]
    WAF[WAF / Load Balancer]
    APIGW[API Gateway]
    CART[cart-api Service]
    REDIS[(Redis Cache)]
    PG[(Postgres Orders / Cart DB)]
    DIAL[EPAM DIAL Gateway]
    LLM[Language Model Provider]
    IDP[Identity Provider]
    LOGS[(Audit / App Logs)]
    OBS[Observability Stack]

    subgraph TB1["Trust Boundary 1: User ↔ Application Perimeter"]
        U
        CDN
        WAF
        APIGW
    end
    style TB1 stroke-dasharray: 5 5

    subgraph TB2["Trust Boundary 2: App Service Tier"]
        CART
        REDIS
        PG
        LOGS
        OBS
    end
    style TB2 stroke-dasharray: 5 5

    subgraph TB3["Trust Boundary 3: Third-Party / External Services"]
        DIAL
        LLM
        IDP
    end
    style TB3 stroke-dasharray: 5 5

    U -->|checkout request (untrusted)| CDN
    CDN -->|HTTPS request| WAF
    WAF -->|routed API call| APIGW
    APIGW -->|authenticated cart / checkout request| CART

    CART -->|session / cart lookup| REDIS
    REDIS -->|cached cart state| CART

    CART -->|read/write orders and cart data| PG
    PG -->|order / cart records| CART

    CART -->|OIDC / token validation| IDP
    IDP -->|identity claims / auth result| CART

    CART -->|cart summary prompt + cart contents| DIAL
    DIAL -->|governed model request| LLM
    LLM -->|summary response| DIAL
    DIAL -->|model response| CART

    CART -->|application / audit events| LOGS
    CART -->|metrics, logs, traces| OBS
    APIGW -->|gateway metrics / access logs| OBS
    DIAL -->|AI gateway telemetry / cost signals| OBS

    CART -->|checkout response / cart summary| APIGW
    APIGW -->|HTTPS response| WAF
    WAF -->|response| CDN
    CDN -->|response| U
